  planner_response {
    response: "I have completed the full implementation of **WEBSITE2HOST**, an AI-powered web project to Hostinger deployment converter.\n\n### Functional & Visual Highlights\n\n- **Autonomous Conversion Pipeline**: Built an end-to-end multi-step workflow spanning **Import**, **Analyze**, **Repair**, **Build**, **Validate**, **Download**, and **Live Preview**.\n- **Multi-Source Ingestion Engine**:\n  - Drag-and-drop ZIP extraction and folder directory processing using JSZip.\n  - Live URL snapshot scraper with server-side proxying and CORS fallback.\n  - Four interactive preset templates (*Vite SaaS Dashboard*, *Next.js Portal*, *PHP MySQL Blog*, and *Static Portfolio*).\n- **Architecture Analyzer & Compatibility Scoring**:\n  - Automatically identifies frameworks (React, Vue, Svelte, Next.js, Vite, PHP, static HTML), entry points, package managers, and routing paradigms.\n  - Generates a Hostinger readiness score with detailed breakdown across Frontend, Build, Routing, Assets, Backend, Database, and Env Vars.\n- **Automated Repair & Server Rule Engine**:\n  - Generates optimized Apache/LiteSpeed `.htaccess` configurations with SPA 404 rewrite fallbacks, Gzip compression, and caching headers.\n  - Cleans hardcoded `localhost` URLs and normalizes asset paths for `public_html/` root deployment.\n  - Creates production `robots.txt`, `sitemap.xml`, and `.env.example` templates.\n- **Gemini-Powered Deep Architecture Audit**:\n  - Connects to Gemini 3.7 Flash via a secure server-side proxy to provide custom Hostinger plan tier recommendations, pitfall advisories, and database configuration guidance.\n- **Pre-Flight Validation Suite**:\n  - 14 automated validation checks inspecting webroot files, `.htaccess` rewrite syntax, sensitive keys, and asset relative paths.\n- **Interactive Multi-Device Sandbox & Live Preview**:\n  - Simulates the converted web application across Desktop, Tablet (768px), and Mobile (375px) viewports with inlined styles and simulated URL bars.\n- **One-Click Package Download & hPanel Guides**:\n  - Exports a clean, deployment-ready `website-hostinger-ready.zip` containing `public_html/`, `HOSTINGER_DEPLOYMENT.md`, and an interactive `conversion-report.html`."
    thinking: "**Verifying Project Checklist**\n\nOkay, I\'ve confirmed the full-stack architecture is in place with Express and Vite, and the Gemini client has lazy loading implemented. I\'ve also verified the file parsing capabilities; we can handle ZIPs, folders, URLs, and those instant test templates. Deep analysis is next on the list.\n\n\n"
