  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Bento Grid Design**\n\nI\'m currently dissecting the Bento Grid design, specifically its aesthetic. The color palette is shaping up: a deep slate-950 background with subtle gradients, and the modules will have a darker, semi-transparent background. The design calls for a sophisticated look that utilizes these dark colors effectively, as I consider overall theme and application to implementation.\n\n\n**Refining Bento Grid Elements**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the finer details. I\'ve settled on radii - 2xl and 3xl for containers, xl for inners. I\'m choosing indigo, violet, emerald and amber as accents, and rose for errors. I\'ve also detailed the slate color scheme for subtle text. I\'ve also specified topbar and sidebar attributes, like a slate 900 background with a blur, and nav item design.\n\n\n"
