steps {
  type: CORTEX_STEP_TYPE_USER_INPUT
  status: CORTEX_STEP_STATUS_DONE
  metadata {
    created_at {
      seconds: 1787270635
      nanos: 582763372
    }
    source: CORTEX_STEP_SOURCE_USER_EXPLICIT
  }
  user_input {
    user_response: "Use this prompt:\n\n> **UPDATE ONLY \342\200\224 ADD HERO EFFECT**\n>\n> Do **not** redesign, restructure, rewrite, or remove anything from the existing website. Preserve the current HTML, CSS, typography, colors, layout, content, buttons, ticker, stickers, spacing, responsive behavior, and all existing functionality exactly as they are. The existing hero structure already uses a full-screen `.hero` section, centered headline, ticker, grain texture, floating stickers, CTAs, and glitch headline effect.  \n>\n> **ONLY add a premium interactive hero visual effect behind the existing content.**\n>\n> ### HERO EFFECT\n>\n> Add a subtle **interactive cinematic mouse-following glow / energy field** inside the existing hero section.\n>\n> Requirements:\n>\n> * Effect stays strictly inside `.hero`\n> * Must appear **behind all existing text, buttons, ticker, and stickers**\n> * Do not change the existing content\n> * Do not change the existing color palette\n> * Do not change the existing layout\n> * Do not add another hero section\n> * Do not replace the existing glitch headline\n> * Do not remove the existing grain effect\n> * Do not change the existing fonts\n>\n> ### Interaction\n>\n> Create a soft radial light that follows the user\'s mouse position.\n>\n> Add:\n>\n> * Subtle lime glow\n> * Very subtle magenta secondary glow\n> * Smooth interpolation / inertia\n> * Slow ambient movement when the mouse is not moving\n> * Slight cinematic depth/parallax\n> * No aggressive flashing\n> * No distracting particles\n> * No performance-heavy 3D libraries\n>\n> The effect should feel like a **premium Gen-Z futuristic fashion / tech landing page**: dark, experimental, cinematic, minimal, expensive, and polished.\n>\n> ### PERFORMANCE\n>\n> Use lightweight HTML/CSS/vanilla JavaScript only.\n>\n> * GPU-friendly transforms\n> * `requestAnimationFrame`\n> * No unnecessary libraries\n> * No layout thrashing\n> * Mobile optimized\n> * Disable or simplify the mouse-follow effect on touch devices\n> * Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`\n>\n> ### LAYERING\n>\n> Maintain the existing visual hierarchy:\n>\n> `hero background \342\206\222 new interactive glow \342\206\222 grain \342\206\222 existing content`\n>\n> The new effect must never cover or reduce readability of the existing interface.\n>\n> ### FINAL RULE\n>\n> **THIS IS AN ENHANCEMENT, NOT A REDESIGN.**\n>\n> Change **only what is necessary to add the hero effect**. Keep everything else pixel-consistent with the current website.\n>\n> After implementation, verify that:\n>\n> * Desktop works\n> * Mobile works\n> * Existing animations still work\n> * Existing buttons still work\n> * Existing ticker still works\n> * Existing glitch hover still works\n> * No console errors\n> * No horizontal overflow\n> * No visual layout shifts\n> * No existing functionality is broken."
    items {
      text: "Use this prompt:\n\n> **UPDATE ONLY \342\200\224 ADD HERO EFFECT**\n>\n> Do **not** redesign, restructure, rewrite, or remove anything from the existing website. Preserve the current HTML, CSS, typography, colors, layout, content, buttons, ticker, stickers, spacing, responsive behavior, and all existing functionality exactly as they are. The existing hero structure already uses a full-screen `.hero` section, centered headline, ticker, grain texture, floating stickers, CTAs, and glitch headline effect.  \n>\n> **ONLY add a premium interactive hero visual effect behind the existing content.**\n>\n> ### HERO EFFECT\n>\n> Add a subtle **interactive cinematic mouse-following glow / energy field** inside the existing hero section.\n>\n> Requirements:\n>\n> * Effect stays strictly inside `.hero`\n> * Must appear **behind all existing text, buttons, ticker, and stickers**\n> * Do not change the existing content\n> * Do not change the existing color palette\n> * Do not change the existing layout\n> * Do not add another hero section\n> * Do not replace the existing glitch headline\n> * Do not remove the existing grain effect\n> * Do not change the existing fonts\n>\n> ### Interaction\n>\n> Create a soft radial light that follows the user\'s mouse position.\n>\n> Add:\n>\n> * Subtle lime glow\n> * Very subtle magenta secondary glow\n> * Smooth interpolation / inertia\n> * Slow ambient movement when the mouse is not moving\n> * Slight cinematic depth/parallax\n> * No aggressive flashing\n> * No distracting particles\n> * No performance-heavy 3D libraries\n>\n> The effect should feel like a **premium Gen-Z futuristic fashion / tech landing page**: dark, experimental, cinematic, minimal, expensive, and polished.\n>\n> ### PERFORMANCE\n>\n> Use lightweight HTML/CSS/vanilla JavaScript only.\n>\n> * GPU-friendly transforms\n> * `requestAnimationFrame`\n> * No unnecessary libraries\n> * No layout thrashing\n> * Mobile optimized\n> * Disable or simplify the mouse-follow effect on touch devices\n> * Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`\n>\n> ### LAYERING\n>\n> Maintain the existing visual hierarchy:\n>\n> `hero background \342\206\222 new interactive glow \342\206\222 grain \342\206\222 existing content`\n>\n> The new effect must never cover or reduce readability of the existing interface.\n>\n> ### FINAL RULE\n>\n> **THIS IS AN ENHANCEMENT, NOT A REDESIGN.**\n>\n> Change **only what is necessary to add the hero effect**. Keep everything else pixel-consistent with the current website.\n>\n> After implementation, verify that:\n>\n> * Desktop works\n> * Mobile works\n> * Existing animations still work\n> * Existing buttons still work\n> * Existing ticker still works\n> * Existing glitch hover still works\n> * No console errors\n> * No horizontal overflow\n> * No visual layout shifts\n> * No existing functionality is broken."
    }
  }
}
