    thinking: "**Considering Import Integration**\n\nI\'m now weighing the best approach to integrate the GitHub import. Should I create a dedicated `GitHubImportCard.tsx` component, fold it into `ImportView.tsx` with a tabbed interface, or present both prominently? I\'m examining `ImportView.tsx` to best determine its structure for a smooth import experience.\n\n\n**Designing Import Workflow**\n\nI\'ve decided to proceed with a tabbed interface in `ImportView.tsx`, incorporating distinct segments for various import methods. Specifically for GitHub, I\'m developing a dedicated `GitHubImportCard.tsx` with sections for repository input, advanced settings (branch/subdirectory/PAT), live validation, and one-click import options. I also plan to show a progress bar with informative messages during the import process to help guide the user.\n\n\n"
