  planner_response {
    response: "I have implemented and integrated the **Direct GitHub Repository Import** feature for GoDeploy:\n\n- **Direct GitHub Repository Pipeline**:\n  - Connect public or private GitHub repositories by URL (e.g. `github.com/owner/repo`, `owner/repo`, or nested branch URLs `owner/repo/tree/main/subfolder`).\n  - Automatic repository metadata resolution via the GitHub API with custom branch and subfolder extraction.\n  - Support for optional GitHub Personal Access Tokens (PAT) to import private repositories and avoid rate limits.\n  - Quick-start one-click templates for popular open-source starters (React + Vite, Tailwind Portfolio, Modern Landing Page).\n\n- **Backend Extraction & Decompression**:\n  - Added the `/api/github-import` proxy endpoint in `server.ts` to stream, unpack, and decode GitHub repository zipballs into the GoDeploy file schema without browser CORS blocks.\n\n- **Interface & Multi-Source Import Switcher**:\n  - Designed an intuitive bento tab selector allowing users to toggle between **GitHub Repository**, **Upload ZIP / Folder**, and **Live Web Snapshot**.\n  - Added contextual repository and branch badges throughout the pipeline inspection stages."
    modified_response: "I have implemented and integrated the **Direct GitHub Repository Import** feature for GoDeploy:\n\n- **Direct GitHub Repository Pipeline**:\n  - Connect public or private GitHub repositories by URL (e.g. `github.com/owner/repo`, `owner/repo`, or nested branch URLs `owner/repo/tree/main/subfolder`).\n  - Automatic repository metadata resolution via the GitHub API with custom branch and subfolder extraction.\n  - Support for optional GitHub Personal Access Tokens (PAT) to import private repositories and avoid rate limits.\n  - Quick-start one-click templates for popular open-source starters (React + Vite, Tailwind Portfolio, Modern Landing Page).\n\n- **Backend Extraction & Decompression**:\n  - Added the `/api/github-import` proxy endpoint in `server.ts` to stream, unpack, and decode GitHub repository zipballs into the GoDeploy file schema without browser CORS blocks.\n\n- **Interface & Multi-Source Import Switcher**:\n  - Designed an intuitive bento tab selector allowing users to toggle between **GitHub Repository**, **Upload ZIP / Folder**, and **Live Web Snapshot**.\n  - Added contextual repository and branch badges throughout the pipeline inspection stages."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
